# ignore public files for now because we need to host it on a server
# public
# Large source PDFs live in tools/ and are optimized into public/magazines/*.pdf
# (see tools/optimize_pdf.sh). Keep the heavy originals out of the repo, but DO
# track the optimized public/magazines/*.pdf that the app actually serves.
/tools/*.pdf
